=== SUMMARY ===
data sources : FleetAPIPageViewModel binds the shared S8 SettingsStore via asFleetApiSource() — four cache-then-network reads projected onto UiState (settings doc -> FleetApiSettings.apiSuspended; PollingConfig; CaptureStats; VersionInfo with isEmpty=endpoints.isEmpty()), and the two non-throwing mutations (toggleApiSuspend -> web useToggleAPISuspend; updatePollingConfig -> web useUpdatePollingConfig). The store refreshes exactly the feeds the matching web hook invalidates (suspend -> settings; polling-config save -> polling-config + capture-stats), so the page self-updates. Per-endpoint toggle flip + enabled/total count + api_suspended parse live in the framework-free FleetAPIPageModel.kt. Toast outcomes (web toast.success/info/error) surface through a Material 3 Snackbar (FleetApiToastBridge). No HTTP in the view.
nav          : Destinations 'fleetApi' -> /fleet-api (pre-existing) wired to FleetApiRoute() via PageHosts.register; TeslaSyncApplication.onCreate() calls FleetAPIPageHost.register(); deep link auto-registered by TeslaSyncNavHost.
units        : no telemetry-unit-bearing field on this page (booleans, counts, a retention-day integer, version strings). The captured-signal count is locale-formatted at the render boundary (NumberFormat over the observable LocalConfiguration locale).
a11y         : IconBox glyphs decorative (contentDescription=null); page accessible name via Modifier.semantics{ paneTitle }; switches are Material Toggle (Role.Switch, >=48dp). Dark/dynamic theme via MaterialTheme tokens only (no hardcoded color).
